  STEP 1_dpapi_password_recovery
    Files: keystorage.password.bin
    Src:   electron-main.ts:944-945 — written without ACL on win32
    Method: DPAPI Unprotect (CurrentUser scope) → raw master password
    On Windows, keystorage.password.bin is a CryptProtectData blob.  A same-user process can decrypt it via CryptUnprotectData / ProtectedData.Unprotect() without user interaction.  No explicit DACL on the file (fileModeInternalObjectIfPosix returns {} on win32 — fs.ts:41).

  STEP 2_argon2id_derive
