  STEP 3_inner_protobuf_decrypt
    Files: keystorage.bin
    Src:   inner/v3.ts:65,70 — InnerKeyStorage protobuf exposes IdentityData.ck + databaseKey
    Method: SecretBox.decrypt(nonce, ciphertext) → InnerKeyStorage protobuf
    After PBKDF decryption, parse the protobuf to extract:
