## Observations for Operator

1. **No new surface.** All 14 leads map to endpoints already documented in `knowledge/index.md`. The probe cycles are re-hitting the same targets with no delta.

2. **Staging ambiguity.** `work.test.threema.ch` and `ds-apip-work.threema.ch` findings keep recurring. scope.yml lists `work.threema.ch` and `apip.threema.ch` (prod) but not their `.test`/`-work` siblings. Recommend operator clarify whether staging and work-directory variants are explicitly in scope.

